  "prefLabel": "Plc 1403.06 Records of Predecessor Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1403.06 Records of Predecessor Board. The records of the recreational therapy governing board that existed prior to July 19, 2022, the effective date of Laws of 2022 ch. 72, shall be:\n\n(a) Retained by the executive director in accordance with the retention schedule established pursuant RSA 310:4, II(e) and available in the frequently asked questions (FAQ) section of the OPLC website at https://www.oplc.nh.gov; and\n\n(b) Available for public review as provided in Plc 100.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442 (formerly Plc 1403.04), eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1400.html"
